<title>UK: Austria sets 100 mln polish zloty 2-year bond.</title>
<headline>Austria sets 100 mln polish zloty 2-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REPUBLIC OF AUSTRIA</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN PLZ   COUPON     19.25 PCT MATURITY    11.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.875   PAY DATE    11.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  5-20-200</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   0.875</p>
<p> NOTES	PAYMENTS WILL BE MADE IN MARKS</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
